      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Key finding:\n- dnsmasq sees query source from 192.168.3.21-25 (DNSOutboundSubnet SNAT pool), not the fixed .20 EP address.\n- Same source pool observed in C1, C2, and C3; DNS alone cannot distinguish agent type.\n- Observable differentiator is HTTP TCP src_ip (diagram 03).",
